  questDescription: Dora the miner here, and my arms are noodles. I want to get as
    much done with every single swing as possible, the best there is! One swing,
    one tunnel, and then a nap.
  requirements:
  - type: 4
    tier: 3
  successText: Yay, now I can dig all the way to the mouse caves!
  partialText: Okay, the tunnel got a bit longer. That should do the work.
  failureText: No, now it's even worse! My arms hurt twice as much!
